# The year in sound away from home (out/reports/audio-seasons.md §5), captured with --audio-out:
# every region plays a bed in every month by day and night; Rome's winter bed replaces its plain
# one after a crossfade; Pārsa's season beds, and its rain bed only under rain; the night; the
# open sea by its state; a mountain under snow; spring frogs by a lake at night; the Saturnalia's
# music on its day only. audio_year_check reads the capture for level,
# balance, clipping and clicks at the crossfades.
expect sound beds
set clock day
set season spring
set world forum 1
wait 30
expect place rome
expect sound amb/rome/day.ogg 10 100
expect sound amb/rome/day_winter.ogg 0 0
expect sound amb/world/dawn_autumn.ogg 0 0
set season winter
fast 25
expect sound amb/rome/day_winter.ogg 10 100
expect sound amb/rome/day.ogg 0 0
set world terrace 1
wait 30
fast 25
expect place parsa
expect sound amb/parsa/plain_day_winter.ogg 10 100
expect sound amb/parsa/rain.ogg 0 0
set season summer
fast 25
expect sound amb/parsa/plain_day_summer.ogg 10 100
expect sound amb/parsa/plain_day_winter.ogg 0 0
set clock night
fast 25
expect sound amb/parsa/plain_night.ogg 10 100
expect sound amb/parsa/plain_day_summer.ogg 0 0
set world district:tyrrhenian/sea 1
wait 30
fast 10
expect region tyrrhenian
expect sound sea.open 10 200
set clock day
set season winter
set world district:zagros/land 1
wait 30
fast 25
expect region zagros
expect sound amb/world/day_snow.ogg 10 100
set clock night
set season spring
set world district:alban_mount/lake 1
wait 30
fast 10
expect region alban_mount
expect sound amb/world/frogs_spring.ogg 1 100
expect sound river 1 200
# A festival's music on its day only: the Saturnalia (winter's first day, from 18:00) in the
# Subura, and nothing of it the next evening.
set season auto
set clock auto
set day 9
set time 0.5
set world district:rome/subura 1
waitfor 1200 city event saturnalia yes
wait 30
expect sound amb/rome/saturnalia.ogg 1 100
set day 10
set time 0.5
waitfor 600 city event saturnalia no
wait 30
expect sound amb/rome/saturnalia.ogg 0 0
quit
